{"4444220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Prince of Egypt", "steam_appid": 4444220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise from a dying slave to a powerful noble in Ancient Egypt. Survive the desert, master trade, forge alliances, fight or steal your way to influence, and help build monuments that will shape an empire. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-World Survival RPG set in Ancient Egypt </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desert survival mechanics: heat, thirst, hunger... </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple progression paths: farmer, merchant, warrior, thief...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic trade and economy system </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee combat and stealth gameplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monumental construction system </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tomb exploration and treasure hunting </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4444220/extras/69a7273e207dc4342b9a3e6654b3d2da.poster.avif?t=1779808346\" width=800 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4444220/extras/69a7273e207dc4342b9a3e6654b3d2da.webm?t=1779808346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4444220/extras/69a7273e207dc4342b9a3e6654b3d2da.mp4?t=1779808346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Brutal Desert</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heat is relentless. Water is scarce. Food must be earned. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage thirst, hunger, exhaustion, and exposure as you navigate one of history’s harshest environments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Nile offers life — but beyond its banks lies death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4444220/extras/9a5e3e2aec08e8397bbbe9f71eb5ef2c.poster.avif?t=1779808346\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4444220/extras/9a5e3e2aec08e8397bbbe9f71eb5ef2c.webm?t=1779808346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4444220/extras/9a5e3e2aec08e8397bbbe9f71eb5ef2c.mp4?t=1779808346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Your Own Path</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not bound to a single destiny. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become a respected farmer along the Nile, a master craftsman shaping tools and weapons, a merchant controlling trade routes, a shadowy thief moving through the night, or a feared warrior earning glory in battle? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your rise to power is shaped by your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4444220/extras/81d033fe285952068fdd049dea48db5a.poster.avif?t=1779808346\" width=800 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4444220/extras/81d033fe285952068fdd049dea48db5a.webm?t=1779808346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4444220/extras/81d033fe285952068fdd049dea48db5a.mp4?t=1779808346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Trade &amp; Living Economy</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient Egypt thrives on commerce. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish trade routes. Barter resources. Transport goods across cities and settlements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The economy reacts to supply, demand, and regional scarcity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control trade — control influence. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4444220/extras/7c0aef1a03451fecdebd06e67cbdb4f9.poster.avif?t=1779808346\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4444220/extras/7c0aef1a03451fecdebd06e67cbdb4f9.webm?t=1779808346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4444220/extras/7c0aef1a03451fecdebd06e67cbdb4f9.mp4?t=1779808346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat, Stealth &amp; Power</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can engage in brutal melee combat or master stealth and infiltration, choosing between tactical close-quarters combat and stealth-based infiltration, while enjoying equipment progression, as well as reputation and influence systems—because power can be taken, or earned in silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4444220/extras/681ce6289a4e0a08d99ae87cbd1b2d6d.poster.avif?t=1779808346\" width=800 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4444220/extras/681ce6289a4e0a08d99ae87cbd1b2d6d.webm?t=1779808346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4444220/extras/681ce6289a4e0a08d99ae87cbd1b2d6d.mp4?t=1779808346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Build Monuments That Shape History</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contribute to the construction of pyramids, temples, and legendary landmarks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources. Organize labor. Secure influence within Pharaoh’s empire. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your legacy will stand in stone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4444220/extras/3773ca5c988992c7ab3c5246bc007723.poster.avif?t=1779808346\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4444220/extras/3773ca5c988992c7ab3c5246bc007723.webm?t=1779808346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4444220/extras/3773ca5c988992c7ab3c5246bc007723.mp4?t=1779808346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasures &amp; Forgotten Mysteries</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore tombs and ancient ruins. Solve puzzles. Evade deadly traps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover relics lost to time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Egypt hides secrets beneath its sands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4444220/extras/b234befd5995133f9225e5fa51bace7e.poster.avif?t=1779808346\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4444220/extras/b234befd5995133f9225e5fa51bace7e.webm?t=1779808346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4444220/extras/b234befd5995133f9225e5fa51bace7e.mp4?t=1779808346\" type=\"video/mp4